OL,3,GNEWSAWait to welcome public to
OL,4,AWordsworth's home goes on
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo date has been set for the reopening
OL,7,Fof poet William Wordsworth's final home
OL,8,Fto the public after it was bought by
OL,9,Fthe trust set up in his name.
OL,11,FThe Romantic writer lived in Rydal
OL,12,FMount, in Ambleside, Cumbria, from 1813
OL,13,Funtil his death in 1850 and the house
OL,14,Fwas put on the market by his
OL,15,Fdescendants last year.
OL,17,FIn March the Wordsworth Trust announced
OL,18,Fit had bought the property alongside
OL,19,FThe Julia Rausing Trust and the
OL,20,FCharlotte Aitken Trust and said it
OL,21,Fwould shut for the "immediate future".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
