OL,3,GNEWSAWait to welcome public to
OL,4,AWordsworth's home goes on
OL,5,
OL,6,FWordsworth Trust director Michael
OL,7,FMcGregor said the organisation was
OL,8,Fcurrently working out a new business
OL,9,Fmodel for the site but hoped to open it
OL,10,Fto the public in due course.
